authors:
  - name: "Tender Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MK60DN/Tender"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
abstract: >-
  A research-oriented lifelong-learning system with one shared mentalization core.
  Its world tree separates objective roots, an Agent Bridge trunk and subjective
  experience branches. A dynamic golden-bias regulator separates observation
  windows from evidence-gated rhythm periodicity, combines learning-creation
  balance, novelty and post-creation calibration, and keeps candidate periods
  provisional rather than turning them into a fixed schedule or daily KPI.